      "limits": "Do not export raw Failure, family, participant or hidden event counts. P_OPERATOR_EVENT and GPT05 fixed coarse envelope remain required. The original registry explicitly acknowledges current Core AcceptedResult omits Recovery/Ferry contact-specific output; the new mapping must be accepted as the proposed narrow projection, not falsely described as already returned by Core. LaterEncounter.Interruption is covered as stopped-time evidence; its status mapping is not claimed in the named contact mapping."
    },
    "fixedPolicy": "FIELD_POLICY_DECISIONS_05 overrides historical family proposals. In particular Hide Guidance linkage remains fixed Withheld and operator authorization does not authorize pending work/participant/private cause fields. Generic type availability is never an authority grant.",
